# Python bytecode from the Tools scripts.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Google Mobile Ads plugin, fetched by Tools/install_admob.sh and never committed. Only its settings asset is
# ours: it holds the AdMob app ID and turns off the plugin's EDM install and gradle-template rewriting
# (Assets/Game/Scripts/Editor/AdMobDependencies.cs adds the Android dependencies instead).
/Assets/GoogleMobileAds/*
!/Assets/GoogleMobileAds/Resources/
/Assets/GoogleMobileAds.meta
/Assets/Plugins/Android/
/Assets/Plugins/Android.meta
/Assets/Plugins/iOS/
/Assets/Plugins/iOS.meta
